<section class="section reveal" id="why-design-thinking">
  <span class="section-label">Foundations</span>
  <h2>Why Design Thinking Matters for AI</h2>
  <p>AI systems are products that must solve real problems for real people. The difference between a technically brilliant system and a successful one comes down to design. Good design thinking ensures your AI product addresses genuine user needs, integrates with existing workflows, and delivers measurable value.</p>

  <div class="analogy">
    <h4>💡 Think of It This Way</h4>
    <p>Building an AI system without design thinking is like building a bridge that is structurally perfect but connects two cities that don't need to trade. The engineering is excellent, but solves no one's problem. Design thinking asks: Who needs this? What problem does it solve? How do we know it works?</p>
  </div>

